            "title": "Compare parameter styles",
            "id": 152298,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki adres URL kieruje do wydarzenia o identyfikatorze <code>7</code> przy użyciu parametru trasy?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://api.example.com/events/7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://api.example.com/events?id=7</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://api.example.com/events?id/7</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>https://api.example.com/events/7</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki adres URL kieruje do wydarzenia o identyfikatorze <code>7</code> przy użyciu parametru trasy?</p><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://api.example.com/events/7</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://api.example.com/events?id=7</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://api.example.com/events?id/7</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://api.example.com/events/7?id=event</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://api.example.com/events/7</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Complete a query string",
            "id": 152299,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij parametr zapytania, który filtruje elementy według statusu <code>open</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?status=open&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;status=open\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/status/open\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>?status=open</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij parametr zapytania, który filtruje elementy według statusu <code>open</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?status=open&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"41\" endIndex=\"42\" /><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"48\" /><option startIndex=\"48\" endIndex=\"49\" /><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&amp;\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"closed\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>?</code>, następnie <code>status</code>, <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>open</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Combine query parameters",
            "id": 152300,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Adres URL już filtruje elementy według <code>status=open</code>. Dodaj <code>owner=maya</code> jako drugi parametr zapytania.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?status=open&amp;owner=maya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?owner=maya\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/owner/maya\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>&amp;owner=maya</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Zachowaj filtr <code>status</code> ustawiony na <code>open</code> i dodaj filtr <code>owner</code> dla <code>maya</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?status=open&amp;owner=maya&quot;\" class=\"string\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"49\" endIndex=\"53\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"54\" endIndex=\"59\" /><option startIndex=\"59\" endIndex=\"60\" /><option startIndex=\"60\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"?\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"/\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"closed\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"status\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>open</code>, następnie <code>&amp;</code>, <code>owner</code>, <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>maya</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Build a filter dictionary",
            "id": 152301,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Uzupełnij wpis słownika, który filtruje zgłoszenia według statusu <code>open</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;status&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;open&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"11\" endIndex=\"19\" /><option startIndex=\"21\" endIndex=\"27\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"&quot;closed&quot;\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>\"status\"</code>, a następnie <code>\"open\"</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Pass filters as params",
            "id": 152302,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Przekaż słownik <code>filters</code> za pośrednictwem argumentu <code>params</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;status&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url, params=filters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"134\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"data=filters\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"params=url\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>params=filters</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Pobierz elementy wybrane przez <code>filters</code>, przekazując je jako parametry zapytania.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;status&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url, params=filters)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"111\" endIndex=\"114\" /><option startIndex=\"115\" endIndex=\"118\" /><option startIndex=\"120\" endIndex=\"126\" /><option startIndex=\"127\" endIndex=\"134\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"post\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"json\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"response\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>get</code>, następnie <code>url</code>, <code>params</code> i na końcu <code>filters</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
          },
          {
            "title": "Read the filtered URL",
            "id": 152303,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki adres URL tworzy <code>requests.get()</code> na podstawie tych filtrów?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;category&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;home&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;status&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url, params=filters)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=home&amp;status=active</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things/category/home/status/active</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=home?status=active</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=home&amp;status=active</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki adres URL tworzy <code>requests.get()</code> na podstawie tych filtrów?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"python\" name=\"script.py\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"import\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" requests\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"url = \" /><text value=\"&quot;https://things.mimo.dev/api/things&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"filters = {\" /><text value=\"&quot;category&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;home&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\", \" /><text value=\"&quot;status&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\": \" /><text value=\"&quot;active&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"response = requests.get(url, params=filters)\" /></content></code><selection multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=home&amp;status=active</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things/category/home/status/active</code></item><item value=\"3\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=home?status=active</code></item><item value=\"4\" correct=\"false\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=home&amp;status</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\"><code>https://things.mimo.dev/api/things?category=home&amp;status=active</code>.</p></body></html>",
            "hardModeSelected": true
